<title>USA: National Golf CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>National Golf CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Golf Properties Inc said Monday that Chief Financial Officer Edward Sause has resigned.</p>
<p>The company said Sause resigned to assume the position of executive vice president of finance and corporate strategy for American Golf Corp.</p>
<p>Sause is to retain his seat on National Golf's board of directors and chair the board's newly created finance committee.</p>
<p>In related actions, Neil Miller has been named vice president of finance and William Regan has been named vice president, controller and treasurer, the company said.</p>
<p>National Golf Properties, a real estate investment trust, specializes in the acquisition and ownership of golf course properties.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
